bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -24 \\\\ -24 & 72\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $({A}^{T}\\,A-I)v=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.$ Dividing $v$ by its norm, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|{v}_{12}|+|{v}_{22}|=|\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}|+|\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}|=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{10}}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186385879 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7298123d-e222-5ca3-9525-3902520c925c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385881} {:answer/id #uuid "a7e67d4a-7cab-5968-8a1e-93e5b46651cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{10}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385882} {:answer/id #uuid "6a74b705-8324-5d7f-be04-e583cb227864" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385883} {:answer/id #uuid "402cfa88-7311-577a-a24e-59b6ddd008d0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385884} {:answer/id #uuid "233b2c5f-c4d9-595c-97c1-a8703cfa1574" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385885}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385883} :answer-field/id #uuid "a3fc05ae-4f60-5971-aae9-bcab380baf50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186385880}] :question/id #uuid "758ea834-5946-5f25-9e85-8f4913820e94" :question/math-academy-id "q-96246" :question/problem "$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,Σ=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{bma