/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336552} {:answer/id #uuid "749519ac-5ffb-5882-a880-c78c17af29e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337080} {:answer/id #uuid "76a98bc8-4ae3-5625-94f9-dfbc9ef43953" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337100} {:answer/id #uuid "bbec3956-52fe-53cc-a1b7-e077271f2858" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337702} {:answer/id #uuid "fb172123-feef-5fae-8409-7ad8716809af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338237}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338237} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5cbc7a8-6dca-58cb-a4c1-97d0b8f899be" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338633}] :question/id #uuid "eee59375-327d-52f8-be64-f3ef1a83939b" :question/math-academy-id "q-71712" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2y &=1 \\\\ 3x &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered  $x,y$ \n on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0x-2y &=1 \\\\ 3x+0y &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338975 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3870cf21-5534-5def-99e4-eeae42e4b0ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336558} {:answer/id #uuid "5c02282f-290f-5859-9377-ec1c833fc58a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 2 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336868} {:answer/id #uuid "ad844e1b-c977-50c3-aaa2-5437612f26fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & -6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337588} {:answer/id #uuid "d87232e7-9ac0-5e74-9288-126f3843a691" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337912} {:answer/id #uuid "e979800a-d684-515d-a581-6ee7d81f7d42" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338070}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337912} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d485f3e-94a3-58e5-82d8-2b9ca2129796" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338360}] :question/id #uuid "05b351f4-ec25-5f54-8775-4cda53fe0446" :question/math-academy-id "q-71714" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=3 \\\\ -4y+5z &=6 \\\\ 7x+8z &=9\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+0z &=3 \\\\ 0x-4y+5z &=6 \\\\ 7x+0y+8z &=9\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059768 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059577 :question/id #uuid "b5967dd6-bdf9-5cd0-9639-ec2816d04256" :question/math-academy-id "e-4684" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z &=0 \\\\ z &=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z &=1-2x\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z &=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z &=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\begin{matrix}\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3  \\\\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1  \\\\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t\\end{matrix}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510684 :question-generator/id #uuid "f77d5acf-b3a6-5d1b-aedd-6070174f934d" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186059768.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059969 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uui