organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7x+9y-z &=14 \\\\ -10x+18y+0z &=-11 \\\\ 12x-y-9z &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 9 & -1 \\\\ -10 & 18 & 0 \\\\ 12 & -1 & -9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}7 & 9 & -1 & 14 \\\\ -10 & 18 & 0 & -11 \\\\ 12 & -1 & -9 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510652 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "299f18e1-306c-59b2-8ac6-e39f4936efdf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}19 & 21 & -1 \\\\ 21 & -17 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510639} {:answer/id #uuid "4a495ca1-18c8-5de3-82d5-8c4891fab8a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & 17 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510647} {:answer/id #uuid "5ed9d726-ee7d-5dca-8a93-f4e2c4437927" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & 17 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510651} {:answer/id #uuid "9d6eb01a-f481-58fc-99c6-f23a2013fb0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & -17 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510666} {:answer/id #uuid "bfb3528f-502a-5fd8-b637-7f5b163e9007" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & -17 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510673}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & -17 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510666} :answer-field/id #uuid "e9210944-45d1-5838-bd35-48c7f95a0817" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510681}] :question/id #uuid "631a7a62-9de6-52a1-905e-f326e1c35604" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}19y &=21-x \\\\ 21x-17y+1 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+19y &=21 \\\\ 21x-17y &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 19 \\\\ 21 & -17\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 19 & 21 \\\\ 21 & -17 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510653 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "765cf772-decc-5aa4-a0b1-42435afa7dfb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}21 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510658} {:answer/id #uuid "9c6e2cb9-0fd3-5745-bec7-f49da26dcb9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}21 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510665} {:answer/id #uuid "a7243ecd-5230-5f45-b618-877d609865fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}21 & 1 & 1 & 17 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510667} {:answer/id #uuid "ad7b22a9-ea4b-5ce0-9f47-2e3a5681f385" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}21 & 1 & 1 & 17 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510668} {:answer/id #uuid "cc0eef09-ad33-5079-a291-f9e85ada1855" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}21 & 1 & 1 & 17 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510676}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}21 & 1 & 1 & 17 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510667} :answer-field/id #uuid "754aaa94-9a37-597c-81b8-44cce2ef932d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510657}] :question/id #uuid "64e51d71-516a-501d-91f6-e43b2ae825b6" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}21x+y+z &=17 \\\\ x+z &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}21x+y+z &=17 \\\\ x+0y+z &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}21 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}21 & 1 & 1 & 17 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510656 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a65aca2-38dd-59e3-b1c7-039905c04317" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}8 & 19 & -1 & 6 \\\\ -17 & 21 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 15 & -1 & -19 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510648} {:answer/id #uu