/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058998}] :question/id #uuid "8cbb6f41-79c3-50eb-b078-355f257a5fa8" :question/math-academy-id "q-71730" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2a - b &=-1 \\\\ a + 2b &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186243994 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20e78783-03ff-5f2b-b2e8-3d1d4091c16a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241465} {:answer/id #uuid "23e1b20d-bd3a-531e-b525-17fbd6217e62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241493} {:answer/id #uuid "39cdaace-b472-5e56-ac17-bfc5c1070f71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241697} {:answer/id #uuid "666828da-a5a3-5486-acc1-2549b11b5eb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242105} {:answer/id #uuid "9e76a46f-3e02-5988-ab21-1b1411291324" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242568}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241465} :answer-field/id #uuid "e5a49b94-10a9-5c7d-9f40-0bcb4a707642" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243836}] :question/id #uuid "760765ec-b7b6-54ac-b028-0603c846223a" :question/math-academy-id "q-1070" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2}+4{x}_{1} &=3{x}_{3} \\\\ -11{x}_{3} &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3} &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244042 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1863edce-f2ec-5a50-a21f-05e421f1ea0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186241392} {:answer/id #uuid "7072cee5-2648-59ca-97b2-078189a3001c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242182} {:answer/id #uuid "7be93f80-7c8c-5b43-983a-793f919a89d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -11 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242267} {:answer/id #uuid "b0f0d9d4-4e81-5ba0-91aa-2178ad3b6deb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242720} {:answer/id #uuid "b6d1250e-1895-5e34-abe2-28333a02d8a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242781}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186242182} :answer-field/id #uuid "1c88d913-c353-5501-9331-c6c82155dd5e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186243493}] :question/id #uuid "c33e89a9-178e-58d6-a7fe-c1f9dae2ffc1" :question/math-academy-id "q-1073" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations? \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a-c &=4b \\\\ 3c-11a &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}a-4b-c &=0 \\\\ -11a+0b+3c &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262950 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0acbb9cc-3db1-5c34-93c1-7fc8960f7d77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 4 & 2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259972} {:answer/id #uuid "45cb00db-0f55-5e4c-9c41-33375dee0b1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260484} {:answer/id #uuid "4f1567d5-cdb7-5010-937a-5c816fb34cd7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 9 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260549} {:answer/id #uuid "b94fb6c4-bbf4-5744-b765-ded102eac091" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261498} {:answer/id #uuid "d4ce31d3-e365-58dc-a63d-dfd97d046b99" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{c|c}1 & 9 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261750}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261498} :answer-field/id #uuid "e090c189-3297-54e8-878b-d3da5c293ac7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262515}] :question/id #uuid "211f2486-98ca-57f9-afcd-978296d23dab" :question/math-academy-id "q-129137" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}p+3q &=2 \\\\ 9p-4q &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $p,q$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262953 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2279140c-801d-5652-9f67-e4ce23c8ac5a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260176} {:answer/id #uuid "2e4c7566-b6c0-5c71-9a40-90750ea707c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & 0 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260292} {:answer/id #uuid "3a24c17f-9cbb-5b4f-a095-4ad8e939cd84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & -5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260394} {:answer/id #uuid "9abfc554-f1af-534e-a67b-c1f83ecbb596" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -7 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261218} {:answer/id #uuid "cf4c4db9-76aa-56f2-8a59-224a8d122454" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & 6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261707}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260176} :answer-field/id #uuid "180cfbb0-2978-5516-b5f4-d1f113257b75" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262166}] :question/id #uuid "389b9b37-1144-5c58-ae9f-0547f80b582d" :question/math-academy-id "q-129144" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a &=6b \\\\ 2a-7b &=5 \\\\ 2a-4b+\\frac{3}{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b &=0 \\\\ 2a-7b &=5 \\\\ 2a-4b &=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262954 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "185b4e95-b4a0-5de8-9261-d542718f5c47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260089} {:answer/id #uuid "78034341-3742-5248-aca4-b79ea92704b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260925} {:answer/id #uuid "a173e8eb-2a72-58f0-92da-3bede70514f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261278} {:answer/id #uuid "c9186076-0cb5-5afc-b113-09a238657b5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261653} {:answer/id #uuid "dcde83ec-9e11-55f5-909d-64911ec61004" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & -1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261826}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261653} :answ